{'symbol': 'MGM', 'date': '2021-10-04 09:25:00', 'title': 'PUYALLUP TRIBE OF INDIANS AND BETMGM ESTABLISH PARTNERSHIP TO OPERATE SPORTS BETTING AT EMERALD QUEEN CASINO IN WASHINGTON', 'text': 'TACOMA, WASH., OCT. 4, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- BETMGM, A LEADING SPORTS BETTING AND IGAMING OPERATOR, ANNOUNCED TODAY AN EXCLUSIVE MARKET ACCESS PARTNERSHIP WITH THE PUYALLUP TRIBE OF INDIANS TO OPERATE RETAIL SPORTS BETTING AT THE EMERALD QUEEN CASINO (EQC) IN WASHINGTON STATE.'}